COMICCRAFT – DEPLOYMENT PHASEProject:ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini ModelsFOLDER:6. Deployment PhaseDOCUMENTS:1. ComicCraft_Deployment_Documentation.docx2. README.txtPURPOSE:This folder contains the deployment documentation for the ComicCraft AI Comic Story Creator project.The Deployment Phase explains how the application is prepared, configured, started, tested, and made ready for demonstration or use.DEPLOYMENT COVERS:• Environment Setup• Dependency Installation• API Configuration• Application Startup• Local Deployment• Deployment Verification• Future DeploymentDEPLOYMENT WORKFLOW:Project Files    ?Python Environment    ?Install Dependencies    ?Configure API Credentials    ?Start FastAPI Server    ?Open Web Application    ?Verify Application    ?ComicCraft ReadyEXPECTED RESULT:After deployment, the ComicCraft application should be ready to run through its web interface.The user should be able to enter a story prompt, generate an AI comic, view the generated content, and create the final PDF.SECURITY:API keys and other sensitive configuration information should be kept private and should not be uploaded to public repositories.CONCLUSION:The Deployment Phase provides the required information for preparing and running the ComicCraft application successfully.